      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Great Divide [ToV]\n**Who:**\n- Horasug [ _Raid and Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Glob of Vile Bile [item=137865]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Velketor's Labyrinth [ToV]: Seeking the Sorcerer\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Bled Enraged [npc=56391]\n- Icebound Bledrek [npc=55605]\n- Restless Tijoely [npc=55599]\n- a giant chest [npc=55645]\n- a restless fleshpile [npc=55600]\n- an icy watcher [npc=55598]\n**Era:** | !Torment of Velious\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Dec 18 21:02:31 2019\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Torment of Velious Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nThis group mission starts out with Horasug in The Great Divide TOV\nYou say, 'Hail, Horasug'\nHorasug says, 'Hail, adventurer. I hope you have come to help us deal with the [ **cause**] of this nightmare.'\nYou say, 'What **cause**?'\nHorasug says, 'Well, it must be those rotten giants. It's that sorcerer they got, the one that lives in those caves. Why, if our army wasn't locked up safe and snug inside Thurgadin, we'd have an army in there by now to take off his head and stop all this. But you... you might be able to help us. You can gather up an [army] of your adventurin' types and go on in there and deal with him, right? I mean, you might even have success with a smaller [ **group**] if you were real, real tough. I'm not gonna lie to you, that old giant with the stupid hat is dangerous, but maybe you should at least try.\nYou say, We have a small **group**.'\nHorasug says, 'You think you can do it, eh? Well then, when yer [ **ready**] I know a secret way in. Learnt it from my pa.' _[sic]_\nYou have been assigned the task 'Seeking the Sorcerer'.\n\n---\n\nUpon zoning in, there will be a gargoyle to your left named _an icy watcher_ Hail to begin the event.\nYou say, Hail, an icy watcher'\nAn icy watcher says, 'Hush! It will hear you. It's gone mad. The whole place has gone mad. Wait, I know what you are. You're one of those creatures that goes into other people's homes and kills them, right? Well, why don't you go kill the insane creatures that used to serve Velketor and are now trying to kill him? Go do what you do, whenever you are [ **ready**]. Sooner would be better. Of course you could just [leave]. I sure wish I could.'\nYou say, 'We are **ready**.\nRestless Tijeoly roars as it turns to face its enemies. You hear a responding roar from inside the structure.\nAn icy watcher says, 'Good. Good. Free the sorcerer. He'll be able to set things right. I know it.'\n_The Coldain think that Velketor might be the source of the evil ice that has devastated Velious. Your task is to clear out the undead and force the sorcerer to tell you how to stop the evil that he has created._\n1. Free the sorcerer Velketor so that you can speak with him about his restless ice 0/1 (Velketor's Labyrinth)\n\n\n\nBoss 1: Restless Tijeoly - DPS as fast as possible. If you get adds, push-root them away if possible. You manage adds during a mechanic in the second phase of the event.\n\n\n\n\nBoss 2: Icebound Bledrek - During this phase, there will be red rings placed around the ground. There is an AoE that goes off, but does little damage. After the AoE/red ring, a hay-looking object will be on the ground. Have a member of the group pick it up. This item is clickable and allows you to place a green ring somewhere. Place this green ring away from the current min-boss you are fighting. Once placed, all the adds will be attracted to this green ring and leave your group alone.\n\n\n\n\nBoss 3: Bled Enraged - DPS fast again. There shouldn't be any more adds at this point. Occasionally during this phase, a witch may appear. Mez or root away as able, then deal with after the boss.\n5. Convince Velketor to stop his evil ice 0/1 (Velketor's Labyrinth)\n\n\n\nYou say, Hail, Vlketor the Sorcerer'\n\n\n\n\nVelketor the Sorcerer says, 'Thank you! You've saved my life. I hope you've been sent by my king to help, though he has never been overly fond of [ **me**].\n\n\n\n\nYou say, Why hasn't he been fond of **me**?\n\n\n\n\nVelketor the Sorcerer says, 'Me? Tormax has no love for me. But I do have some idea as to the source of this horrible magic. I want this horror to stop, but I must protect my [ **people**]. I refuse to tell you what I know unless you can promise to help me.\n\n\n\n\nYou say, 'What about your **people**?\n\n\n\n\nVelketor the Sorcerer says, 'Rescue them. I will tell you what I can when I can also report what I know to my King.'\n\n\n\n\nYour task ' Seeking the Sorcerer' has been updated.\n9. Open the giant chest 0/1 (Velketor's Labyrinth)\n\n\n\nYour task ' Seeking the Sorcerer' has been updated.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n425 platinum\nYou gain experience!\n68x Froststone Ducat\n**Submitted by:** Cylius & Laurana\n- Froststone Ducat [item=137538]",
